{"title":"DRAGON COLLECTION","description":"\u003cp\u003eEvery element—from the masterfully handcrafted dragon inlays to the flawless, mirror-like finish—is a testament to uncompromising craftsmanship, timeless elegance, and the pursuit of perfection. More than a playing instrument, the Imperial Dragon is a collectible work of art, created for those who demand excellence without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"pampanga-dragon-001","title":"Dragon - X002 (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eA striking blend of traditional craftsmanship and premium exotic materials, this handcrafted custom cue is designed for players and collectors who appreciate elegance, precision, and exceptional detail. The cue features a stunning hand-inlaid dragon motif crafted from genuine Mother of Pearl and Abalone, creating a captivating centerpiece that reflects beautifully under any lighting.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt with a rich \u003cstrong\u003eEbony wood handle\u003c\/strong\u003e for a solid, balanced feel, and complemented by a beautifully figured \u003cstrong\u003eWenge wood forearm and butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue offers both timeless aesthetics and outstanding performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLength:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial 3\/8 × 8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wenge Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wenge Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Genuine Mother of Pearl \u0026amp; Abalone Dragon Inlay\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43439507963952,"sku":null,"price":40000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul28_2026_04_08_28PM.png?v=1785226129"},{"product_id":"imperial-dragon-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Dragon – X001","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eCrafted from \u003cstrong\u003epremium ashwood\u003c\/strong\u003e, this exceptional cue features an intricately handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003edragon motif\u003c\/strong\u003e brought to life with shimmering \u003cstrong\u003eabalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e, symbolizing strength, wisdom, and prosperity. Flowing \u003cstrong\u003eresin accents\u003c\/strong\u003e seamlessly enhance the forearm and butt sleeve, creating remarkable depth, contrast, and visual elegance. The \u003cstrong\u003ewrapless canadian maple handle\u003c\/strong\u003e preserves the uninterrupted beauty of the natural grain while providing a smooth, comfortable feel and exceptional control.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEngineered for discerning players and collectors, the Imperial Dragon pairs breathtaking artistry with tournament-ready performance. The \u003cstrong\u003epremium Kielwood shaft\u003c\/strong\u003e delivers outstanding stability and consistency, while the \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Diamond tip\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eUS phenolic ferrule\u003c\/strong\u003e, and precision \u003cstrong\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/strong\u003e provide a solid, responsive hit with every shot. Completing this premium package is a \u003cstrong\u003ematching custom extension\u003c\/strong\u003e, seamlessly integrated to complement the cue's striking design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCue Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 58\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShaft:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Kielwood Shaft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTip:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black Diamond Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFerrule:\u003c\/strong\u003e US Phenolic Ferrule\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Ashwood with Handcrafted Dragon Design, Resin \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wrapless Premium Ashwood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Ashwood with Resin \u0026amp; Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccessories:\u003c\/strong\u003e Matching Custom Extension Included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLegendary artistry. Exceptional craftsmanship. Built to perform and destined to be admired for generations.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43453562781744,"sku":null,"price":45000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/94aa14a0-076f-48b8-a897-8b8360415369.png?v=1785662302"},{"product_id":"dragon-s-shadow-handcrafted-custom-pool-cue-cues-master","title":"Dragon’s Shadow – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Elite Cue","description":"\u003cp\u003eDark, powerful, and unmistakably distinctive, the \u003cstrong\u003eDragon’s Shadow\u003c\/strong\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue inspired by the strength, mystery, and legendary presence of the dragon. Built from \u003cstrong\u003epremium palm wood\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue showcases dramatic natural grain patterns that give every section a unique character, depth, and organic beauty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe rich palm wood is enhanced by a sleek \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-gloss black finish\u003c\/strong\u003e, creating a sophisticated foundation for the centerpiece of the design—the \u003cstrong\u003edragon-inspired handcrafted abalone inlays\u003c\/strong\u003e incorporated into the grip. Carefully shaped from shimmering abalone, the intricate inlay work captures the flowing form and spirit of a dragon, revealing flashes of natural color and brilliance as the cue moves under the light.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComplementing the organic character of the palm wood is elegant \u003cstrong\u003eblack and white decorative ringwork\u003c\/strong\u003e, adding clean definition and visual balance throughout the cue. The precision \u003cstrong\u003eRadial pin\u003c\/strong\u003e completes the construction, providing a solid and secure connection between the butt and shaft.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Dragon’s Shadow is a striking expression of craftsmanship where \u003cstrong\u003enatural palm wood, polished black detailing, and handcrafted abalone artistry\u003c\/strong\u003e come together in one distinctive design. Because every piece of palm wood carries its own unique grain pattern, each cue possesses a character that is truly its own.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWood:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium Palm Wood\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dragon-Inspired Handcrafted Abalone Inlays\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGrip:\u003c\/strong\u003e Palm Wood with Dragon-Inspired Abalone Inlay Design\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-Gloss Black Finish\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRingwork:\u003c\/strong\u003e Custom Black \u0026amp; White Decorative Rings\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConstruction:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handcrafted Custom Cue\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBrand:\u003c\/strong\u003e Elite Cue\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDark elegance. Natural character. Legendary craftsmanship. A cue designed to make a statement before the first shot is played.\u003c\/strong\u003e 🐉🎱\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Elite Cue","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43484548726832,"sku":null,"price":35000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/78910.png?v=1786598344"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/collections\/94aa14a0-076f-48b8-a897-8b8360415369.png?v=1785894521","url":"https:\/\/www.elitecue.shop\/collections\/dragon-collection.oembed","provider":"Elite Cue","version":"1.0","type":"link"}